sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Specialist
  participant API as PublishingService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  M->>API: GET /moderation/submissions (oldest first)
  M->>API: POST /submissions/:id/claim
  API->>DB: not decided, not claimed by other within 30 min, narration ready
  API->>DB: claim, listing submitted -> in_review
  loop each page
    M->>API: POST /submissions/:id/pages/:pageId/view {comment}
    API->>DB: upsert review_page_views
  end
  M->>API: POST /submissions/:id/decision {decision, comment, issueStrike}
  Note over M: 7-rule pedagogical checklist is checked on the web, not sent
  API->>DB: decision allowed for review type?
  alt approved but coverage < 100% or narration not ready
    API-->>M: 422 must view all pages
  else changes_requested / rejected without comment
    API-->>M: 422 comment required
  else ok
    API->>DB: save decision, listing status, close open reports
    opt rejected / taken_down
      API->>DB: issueStrikeTx (3 active strikes -> seller suspended)
    end
    API-->>M: 200
  end
